+**Edge Cases and Pitfalls:**
+* **Boundaries:** Clamping coordinates to $[0, R-1]$ prevents out-of-bounds reads but may introduce artifacts at volume edges [S4, S7].
+* **Zero Magnitude:** If $L \le 10^{-6}$, the gradient direction is undefined; the vector is set to $\mathbf{0}$ to avoid division by zero [S4].
+* **Precision:** Signed 8-bit quantization represents numbers in the range $[-127, 127]$, which may lose precision for high-frequency gradients [S6].
 
